{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-12_beg",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-12",
  "title": "高空拒阻行動",
  "storyCode": "14-14",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-12_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1faa42cafa9595be44da402f749ad4d67c869e4e85476c20efa3423fdb4171d3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "終端裡的聲音",
      "text": "烏薩斯的皇帝拒絕接見我們的使者，他們依然將卡茲戴爾視作一個獨立的敵方政權。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "終端裡的聲音",
      "text": "派往薩爾貢的使者還沒有回信，萊塔尼亞的那位選帝侯表達了積極交流的意願……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "終端裡的聲音",
      "text": "大公爵們在戰場上那道金光出現之後，進攻意圖十分明顯。我們的外圍陣線正在收縮……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "終端裡的聲音仍在忠實地為這場戰爭的主導者彙報著每一條戰線的最新動向。\n戰爭的天平正微微搖晃，不願屈服的人們將自己化作砝碼，一次次渴望改變它傾斜的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "無論在什麼時候，特雷西斯的背脊都永遠筆挺，他早已不會讓自己輕易感覺到疲憊。\n但一切積累的過往都不會輕易消逝，無論是被拯救的，還是被殺死的。\n所以，他也從來不曾忘記肩膀上的重量，尤其是在它們越來越難以承擔的當下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍親衛",
      "text": "殿下，前線傳來消息……維多利亞的國劍已啟動，他們遏制了“阿喃那”的攻勢。我們的戰況吃緊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍親衛",
      "text": "另一方面，曼弗雷德將軍，也未能奪回“生命脊椎”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "骸骨現在被誰掌控，最後的目擊位置在哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍親衛",
      "text": "一支傭兵小隊。赦罪師那邊通報，上面應該還有那個名叫“羅德島”的組織的核心成員。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "“羅德島”……那個人，想必也在吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍親衛",
      "text": "將軍，我們無法確定“生命脊椎”的下一步動向。它對飛空艇和碎片大廈都是威脅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "無妨，相信特蕾西婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "如果他們敢靠近碎片大廈……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "我的劍會賜予那個人我承諾過的審判。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "倫蒂尼姆的天空早已被紅色浸染，永不彌散的陰雲已不復存在，在無數枝蔓的托舉下，巨大的晶體如同剛剛結出的果實。\n一切已經準備就緒。\n但此時，唯有此時，他卻不想去思考有關未來的一切。\n飛空艇漫長的盤旋與試探已經接近尾聲，巫術的巨構又一次掠過碎片大廈的上空。\n他知道，這是最後一次了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "航行的飛空艇之中，粉白長髮的薩卡茲獨自佇立在走廊裡。\n她的視線終於從碎片大廈移開，她已不會再看見那個人的身影。\n特蕾西婭的目光投向飛空艇的陰影中，投向這片她已經看過無數次的大地。\n心碎和絕望仍在蔓延。這片大地如今的模樣，與當年她離開卡茲戴爾的時候……有了分別嗎？\n低沉的聲音在她身邊迴盪，那是這艘船的主人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船艙中的影子",
      "text": "特蕾西婭，我能感知到——那位“魔王”，仍在追逐我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "text": "……他們都不是輕言放棄的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船艙中的影子",
      "text": "……呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "死魂靈不再言語，飛空艇開始了最後的提速。\n“原點”已經近在眼前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "虛幻的浪潮卻驟然湧來，時間與空間的亂流在飛空艇周身盤旋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船艙中的影子",
      "text": "他們來了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "text": "而這點星火，一定會為我們燃盡腐朽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "text": "既然如此，就看看他們能走多遠吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "這骨頭架子真是這麼開的嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "赫德雷真的說服了這具骨頭老老實實幫我們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "這你得問他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "他現在連一句完整的話都說不出來，我問他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "那就相信他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "……嘖。他最好沒搞錯什麼步驟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我說，現在這個骨頭架子也回到我們手裡了，是不是該去執行最初的計劃了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "用這個塞滿炸彈的大傢伙，把碎片大廈和特雷西斯炸上天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "有更重要的問題擺在我們面前。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "“阿喃那”現在的狀態怎麼樣了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "從舷窗裡可以看到，風暴雖然已經停息，但天空還是一片令人不安的赤紅。\n“阿喃那”，像是天空的創口，高懸在碎片大廈的正上空。\n飛空艇正徑直飛向本不該存在於世的古老遺跡，接近這片大地最深奧的秘密。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "飛空艇，正在向“阿喃那”飛去。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "特雷西斯始終沒有在戰場上動用它。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "那只有一種解釋。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "比起被當作武器，它還有更重要的使命。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "他難道是想讓飛空艇撞向那塊“源石”？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "“阿喃那”的內部有什麼？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "……",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "嘖，兜帽人，她這意思是在殺死特雷西斯之前，需要先解決飛空艇。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "沒錯吧，老女人？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "是的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "那我們就先把飛空艇打下來再說。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是誰在駕駛飛空艇？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "特雷西斯還會相信誰？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "……哈？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我能感受得到……",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "她……特蕾西婭小姐在那裡，是嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "……是的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "如果我們去追擊飛空艇，接下來的戰鬥，毫無疑問會直面她。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "我們要做好——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "哈哈。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "你想說，我們要做好殺了她的準備？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "……",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "如果……這是必須的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "真了不起。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "我還以為你和殿下關係還不錯呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "凱爾希，你是不是永遠都在做這樣的權衡？文明啦，大地啦——為了這些東西，你可以殺掉任何人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "哪怕……她是特蕾西婭。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "……",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "哼。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "但我和你不一樣，凱爾希。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "我會從眾魂中救出殿下，我會結束這一切。如果你們不想做，那就我來做。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "等著瞧吧……等著瞧吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "不會再有一次背叛了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "博士，我有理由相信，此時此地，你是最能保持理智的人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "接下來的所有作戰指揮，希望可以交給你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "交給我吧。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "別光說好聽的，我們到底要怎麼拿下飛空艇？這骨頭架子上的武器怎麼看都不夠多。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不是“拿下”，是“運走”。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "用“生命脊椎”的力量傳送飛空艇。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "這樣可以？那個飛空艇看起來可是和骨頭架子差不多大。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "你的戰術變得很激進啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "沒有追求穩妥的餘裕了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "這是最後的機會。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "的確是唯一的辦法，且值得一試。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "我會盡力為骸骨提供庇護，以應對飛空艇的炮火。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "只要能讓骸骨接觸到飛空艇，我們就有勝機。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我相信博士，我也可以協助Logos先生。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "既然大家都同意這個計劃，W……",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "讓“生命脊椎”漂流到飛空艇上方。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "哈……搞得好像我怕了一樣。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "老骨頭，醒醒，我們又要出發了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "都抓好了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "幻境消散，漣漪歸於平靜。\n只一瞬間，他們的身下，已是——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "小心——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "澎湃的巫術光束一瞬間激發，毀滅的能量衝刷著它所能接觸的一切。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "飛空艇的應對很快！它早就做好了我們會跟上來的準備！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "在光束摧枯拉朽地湮滅一切之前，銀色的咒言浮起，這些文字彷彿帶有某種引力，竭力拉扯著巫術的洪流。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "“一切術法，只以我劃定的路線前行。”",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "毀滅的能量偏轉了角度，堪堪從巨獸骸骨的縫隙中掠過，只餘下白骨上深深的擦痕。\n能量漸漸消散，主炮的射擊終於結束。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "飛空艇中的巫術陣列放大了死魂靈術法的力量。我們無法抵禦第二次主炮的轟擊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "抓緊時間，靠近飛空艇。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "無數的巫術無人機已經升空，身著染血長袍的巫靈們騰空而起。\n他們皆已向骸骨所在的位置奔襲而來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "這些人的反應真是夠快的！還真忍心啊……這骨頭架子不是他們的寶貝嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "特雷西斯打算讓我們跟骨頭架子一起直接蒸發在這裡？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "W小姐，還差一點，這個距離“生命脊椎”沒有辦法與飛空艇連接！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "不行，飛空艇的火力有點猛，我們是沒辦法安穩靠近了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "哈，你們想來點刺激的嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "我們只能——這樣！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "巨大的轟鳴，巨大的哀鳴。\n龐大的骸骨直接撞擊在了飛空艇的裝甲之上。\n藍紫色的神經束盡力延展著，包裹一切可攀附之物，將飛空艇緊緊纏繞。脆弱的骨板碎裂，從高空墜下，消失於枝蔓之中。\n死魂靈在咆哮，軀體的束縛使它憤怒，這種大膽與褻瀆更使它瘋狂。\n哪怕還未踏上飛空艇的甲板，死魂靈的嘶吼已然釘入了每個薩卡茲的心中。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "成功了！抓住飛空艇了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "W，開始行動。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "把飛空艇一起帶走。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "別指揮我！我知道該怎麼做！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "骨頭架子！到你發揮！快動——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "等等——為什麼不動了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "喂喂？給點反應！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "巨獸骸骨受創很嚴重，它的靈魂好像再一次遊走了——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "這種時候？！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "這樣下去骸骨反而會被飛空艇拖走的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "博士，我們該怎麼辦？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "跳幫戰。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "靠我們自己去阻止飛空艇。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "好傢伙，你的戰術真是越來越大膽，我都忍不住要誇你了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭，凱爾希，你們是最熟悉死魂靈的人。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "嗯，我準備好了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "W，你的炸彈在敵人主場更能發揮作用。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "用不著你說。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Logos，請保護“生命脊椎”。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "text": "半小時內，我必不會讓任何敵人靠近。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "博士，我需要你與我們一同前往飛空艇。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我知道了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "……你沒有猶豫，也沒有提問。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "現在還不是時候，對吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "別廢話了，決定了計劃就趕快走！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "小兔子，我們沿著這道神經束滑過去，別讓自己暴露在那些巫靈的射程裡！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "明白，我會攔截那些流彈。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "博士，凱爾希醫生，我們會清理出登陸場地。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "請務必小心。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "Mon3tr。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "（歡快的嘶鳴）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "抓緊它，博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "有些東西……只有你才能掌控。你也許會是我們艱難時刻中最後的希望。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "就如同你曾經的樣子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Mon3tr抱住你一躍而下，失重的感覺讓你有些慌張，劇烈的風刮得你睜不開眼。\nLogos的咒言與W的歡笑遠遠傳進你的耳朵。爆炸聲連綿不絕，那是薩卡茲的無人機被擊落的聲音。\n失重感終於消失，有人牽住了你的手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我們到了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "……",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "看來有個老傢伙來找我們打招呼了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "這艘船是隻死魂靈，對吧？看來它不怎麼願意有人站在它的頭皮上。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "怪異的影子自金屬的牆壁中析出，一瞬間就擠滿了飛空艇甲板的每個角落。\n它們在微微顫動，它們收縮的節奏就是死魂靈的呼吸本身。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "怪異的影子",
          "text": "……",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "這是死魂靈的造物。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "它早有準備。它不會讓我們輕易將它停下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "簡單，那我們就揍到它不得不停下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "這次，我帶好了足量的炸彈。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
